      "_note": "Highest blast radius of the 5 write tools — no scope limiter on which process, and killing the wrong one has no undo. Inferred risk, confirm." },
    { "tool": "network.flush_dns",     "risk": "low", "params": [],
      "verification": ["network.dns_lookup"],
      "_note": "Inferred low risk — spec's own pilot-rollout example cites 99.9% safe for this tool, the highest of the three cited." },
    { "tool": "temp.clean",            "risk": "low", "params": [],
